# SEO

- Preserve product/category slugs unless explicitly approved
- Primary keywords map to commercial pages, not thin articles
- Block release if important URLs disappear or schema breaks
- Exclude spam URLs from sitemap and redirects (410)
- Connect GSC before production indexing
